---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — FastLicense" description="FastLicense is powered by Cornerstone Licensing, a firm with 28 years of experience and 525,000+ filings.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About FastLicense</h1>
      <p>Speed-focused licensing, backed by 28 years of experience.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 720px;">
      <h2>Why We Built FastLicense</h2>
      <p>Business licensing shouldn't take months. It shouldn't require a law degree. And it definitely shouldn't be the thing that delays your launch.</p>
      <p>FastLicense exists because we saw the same problem over and over: businesses spending weeks researching requirements, filling out wrong forms, getting correction notices, and losing revenue every day they waited.</p>
      <p>We built FastLicense to be the fastest path from "I need a license" to "I'm licensed." Three questions, one specialist, zero confusion.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 40px;">Powered by Cornerstone Licensing</h2>
      <p>Every FastLicense application is prepared and filed by <a href="https://cornerstonelicensing.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cornerstone Licensing</a>, one of the most experienced licensing firms in the country.</p>

      <div class="stat-grid">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num">525,000+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Licenses filed since 1998</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num">28</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Years in business</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num">50</div>
          <div class="stat-label">States covered</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num">99.995%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">On-time submission rate</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num">97%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">First-submission approval rate</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num">9.4 yrs</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Average client relationship</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>Cornerstone's track record matters because licensing is detail work. One wrong field, one missing document, one incorrect fee payment, and your application goes to the back of the line. Their 97% first-submission approval rate is the single biggest reason FastLicense clients get licensed faster.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 40px;">What Makes Us Different</h2>
      <p><strong>One specialist, start to finish.</strong> Your application is handled by a single dedicated specialist who knows your license type, your state, and your timeline. No handoffs. No explaining your situation twice.</p>
      <p><strong>Speed is the product.</strong> We don't just file applications. We optimize for speed at every step: fastest preparation, cleanest submissions, fastest deficiency response. Every day saved is a day you're earning revenue.</p>
      <p><strong>Ongoing compliance.</strong> Getting licensed is step one. Staying licensed is the real challenge. Our Atlas compliance platform tracks every renewal deadline across every state so your licenses never lapse.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to Get Licensed Fast?</h2>
      <p>Get your estimated timeline in 30 seconds.</p>
      <a href="/#quiz">Get Your Timeline</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark) 0%, #1a2744 50%, var(--dark-mid) 100%);
    padding: 56px 0 48px;
    text-align: center;
    color: white;
  }
  .page-hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .page-hero p { color: #94A3B8; font-size: 1.05rem; }

  h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 14px; }

  .stat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 28px 0;
  }
  .stat-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .stat-num { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--primary); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .stat-label { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .stat-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
</style>
